From 8684423246af2cae3cc7f41c188daf5e8355723a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:11:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] refactor(daemon): R8a step 5 the executor takes its OS
 ports from the host (runtime, hostEnv required; planCommandInvocation direct;
 probe takes spawn and hostEnv)

platform gains nodeSpawnPort / createSpawnPort / nodeCommandShell (binding tests first, red then green). The executor's
spawn, process-control and command-planning defaults are deleted with resolveProcessDeps; the five hosts
(server preset, minimal-host, reference-web and the executor tests via one fixture) bind the Node implementations.
The real-stopper default test moves to platform's binding suite; the child_process vi.mock in split-parity is gone.
Debt rows lowered (injection, env-access, size).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
